                         ↑                                                        ↑
                    CPU overhead                                            CPU overhead
	Between the main model kernels and your post-processing, there are CPU gaps (Python overhead) and many tiny kernels (safety/filtering ops running as separate CUDA kernels).
	Step 3: Quantify with nsys stats
	
	
	
	Shell
	nsys stats decode_gaps.nsys-rep --report cuda_gpu_kern_sum
	Show more lines
