	GPU 0: |--gemm--|--attn--|  WAIT  |--allreduce--|--gemm--|
GPU 1: |--gemm--|--attn--|  WAIT  |--allreduce--|--gemm--|
GPU 2: |--gemm--|--attn--|--WAIT--|--allreduce--|--gemm--|
GPU 3: |--gemm--|--attn--|--WAIT--|--allreduce--|--gemm--|
                            ↑           ↑
                      Sync barrier  AllReduce = 0.8ms per layer!
	AllReduce after every attention + MLP layer is 0.8 ms each. With 80 layers × 2 AllReduces per layer = 128 ms of pure communication per decode step.
	Step 3: Check NVLink vs PCIe
	
	
	
	Shell
	nvidia-smi topo -m
	Show more lines
	GPU0  GPU1  GPU2  GPU3
GPU0   X    NV12  SYS   SYS
GPU1  NV12   X    SYS   SYS
GPU2  SYS   SYS    X    NV12
GPU3  SYS   SYS   NV12   X
