								Why Arrow IPC instead of JSON/Protobuf/Kafka serialization:
									1. Zero serialization on hot path — Arrow builders append directly into columnar memory
									2. Zero copy to downstream — consumers read the same shared-memory buffer
									3. Columnar layout — downstream analytics (Velox, Spark, cuDF) can consume directly without transformation
									4. NUMA-aware — Arrow memory pool backed by our NumaArena-style allocator
									5. Batched publish — amortize IPC overhead across many transactions
