																							④ Inter-container shared memory (Kubernetes pod)
																							If the input guardrail and LLM inference run in separate containers within the same pod, they can share data via /dev/shm (which is a tmpfs mount backed by shared memory).
																							In our pod spec (from Story 2):
																							
																							
																							
